---
title: Your progress
description: Your builds, badges and certificates. Kept in this browser only.
permalink: /progress/
---
<div data-progress-page>
<h1 style="--size:1.6rem; --size-md:2.1rem">Your progress</h1>
<p>Everything on this page lives in this browser only. There is no account, and nothing is sent anywhere unless you follow a link that says so.</p>
<p data-storage-warning hidden style="{{ ui.panel }}; {{ ui.note }}">This browser is not saving progress, perhaps because of private browsing. Ticks will be gone when you close the tab.</p>

<section style="{{ ui.panel }}">
  <h2 style="--size:1.05rem; --m:0 0 0.6rem">Continue where you left off</h2>
  <div data-llr-widget><p style="{{ ui.note }}; --m:0">Loading…</p></div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2 style="{{ ui.h2 }}">Your name, for certificates</h2>
  <label style="--d:flex; --fw:wrap; --ai:center; --g:0.5rem">
    <span style="{{ ui.note }}">Printed on certificates. Stays in this browser.</span>
    <input type="text" data-learner-name autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" placeholder="Your name" style="--p:0.4rem; --fg:1; --minw:12rem" />
  </label>
</section>

<section>
  <h2 style="{{ ui.h2 }}">Your builds</h2>
  {% for l in taxonomy.levels %}
  <h3 style="--size:1rem; --mt:1.2rem">
    <span style="{{ ui.chip }}; --bg:var(--c-{{ l.key }}); --size:0.8rem">{{ l.label }}</span>
  </h3>
  <ul style="--lis:none; --p:0; --d:grid; --g:0.5rem">
    {% for lesson in lessons %}{% if lesson.overlay.level == l.key %}
    <li data-progress-row="{{ lesson.slug }}" style="{{ ui.card }}; --p:0.6rem 0.8rem; --bc-on:var(--c-done); --bgc-on:var(--c-done-bg)">
      <p style="--d:flex; --fw:wrap; --ai:baseline; --jc:space-between; --g:0.3rem 0.8rem; --m:0">
        <a href="/lessons/{{ lesson.slug }}/" style="--weight:700">{{ lesson.entry.name }}</a>
        <span data-row-status style="--size:0.8rem">Not started</span>
      </p>
      <p data-row-detail style="--size:0.8rem; --m:0.2rem 0 0"></p>
      <p data-row-cert hidden style="--size:0.8rem; --m:0.2rem 0 0"><a href="/certificate/?lesson={{ lesson.slug }}">Certificate</a></p>
    </li>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section>
  <h2 style="{{ ui.h2 }}">Badges and certificates</h2>
  <p style="{{ ui.note }}">Every badge says what earns it before you have it, and once earned it stays. There are no points, streaks or leaderboards.</p>
  <ul style="--lis:none; --p:0; --d:grid; --g:0.6rem; --gtc-md:1fr 1fr">
    {% for a in achievements %}
    <li data-award="{{ a.id }}" style="{{ ui.card }}; --op:0.6; --op-on:1; --bc-on:var(--c-done)">
      <p style="--d:flex; --jc:space-between; --g:0.5rem; --m:0">
        <strong>{{ a.name }}</strong>
        <span style="--size:0.75rem">{{ "certificate" if a.certificate else "badge" }}</span>
      </p>
      <p style="--size:0.85rem; --m:0.3rem 0 0">{{ a.criteria }}</p>
      <p data-award-date style="--size:0.8rem; --m:0.3rem 0 0">Not yet</p>
      {% if a.certificate %}
      <p data-award-cert hidden style="--size:0.85rem; --m:0.3rem 0 0"><a href="/certificate/?path={{ a.level }}">Get the certificate</a></p>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <h2 style="{{ ui.h2 }}">Your Sage servers</h2>
  <p style="{{ ui.note }}">If you run your own Sage, its Learn link introduces it here, the way n8n's template library remembers your n8n instances. A server you add can receive a lesson's progress when you click "Send", and only then.</p>
  <div data-llr-servers></div>
</section>

<section id="backup">
  <h2 style="{{ ui.h2 }}">Back up and restore</h2>
  <p style="{{ ui.note }}">Safari clears a site's stored data after 7 days of use without a visit, and clearing your browser data removes it too. A backup file keeps your progress safe; importing one merges it with what is here.</p>
  <p style="--d:flex; --fw:wrap; --g:0.6rem; --ai:center">
    <button type="button" data-export style="{{ ui.button }}">Download a backup</button>
    <label style="--d:flex; --ai:center; --g:0.4rem">
      <span>Import a backup</span>
      <input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-import />
    </label>
  </p>
  <p data-import-status aria-live="polite" style="{{ ui.note }}"></p>
  <p style="--mt:1.5rem">
    <button type="button" data-reset style="{{ ui.button }}">Erase all progress on this site</button>
  </p>
</section>
</div>
